#~ msgid ""
#~ "Specify the hardware video decoding API that should be used if possible. "
#~ "Whether hardware decoding is actually done depends on the video codec. If "
#~ "hardware decoding is not possible, mpv will fall back on software "
#~ "decoding. Hardware decoding is disabled by default to maintain "
#~ "reliability. However, modern hardware should support hardware video "
#~ "decoding, reducing CPU usage and power consumption.\\n\\nFor more "
#~ "information visit:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Посочете API за хардуерно декодиране на видео, който трябва да се "
